{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113619","id":3074908909,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc63R2Lt","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113619","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113619.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113619.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113619","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113619/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113619/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113619/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/31307ce856f6006cb3d18b31a76497d47d3db4fb","number":113619,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Ensure correct unlocking of script editor history","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Related to and encountered while looking into https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113042\r\nSeems to be the same issue described in: Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113502\r\n\r\nThe history can be locked, this is done when e.g. restoring the state from the history. Since this involves some deferred signals it can't be instantly unlocked. The approach till now was to unlock in some method that was connected to the deferred signal. But the signal is not consistently emitted. This PR instead defers the unlocking manually to ensure it always happens.\r\n\r\nThe fix relies on a certain behaviour of `call_deferred`.\r\nThe deferred call to emitting the signal happens before the deferred call to unlocking the history. So the method connected to the signal also runs before the history gets unlocked.\r\n\r\nI added this to the documentation to ensure that this is considered stable enough to base a bugfix on it.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followe